{"obsah":"<p>Anyone who has ever experienced an injury, instability or another problem has surely come across Kine-MAX tapes. But the manufacturer doesn't live on tapes alone – the brand's portfolio also includes many other products: balance pads and balls, skipping ropes, massage rollers and balls, and resistance bands.</p>\n\n<p>Every biker who goes all in will surely use some of these products, which we use ourselves, and we hope they'll help you progress in what you're doing or prevent injury.</p>\n\n<p>Products in our shop: <a href=\"https://shop.bikeskills.cz/en/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\"><strong>https://shop.bikeskills.cz/en/</strong></a></p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2Ftejpy.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2Ftejpy.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-228046\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2F563-2_tpx-02.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2F563-2_tpx-02.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-228000\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2F399-8_rayon-02.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2F399-8_rayon-02.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-227955\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\